prompt:
You are a careful expert in reading documents. Here is a grocery shopping receipt. I want you to extract the data: date, grocery store, items with their quantity and prices. Some entries do not have quantities, so omit the field. Output the data in json like this:



{

    "supplier": "FreshCo Bonny Doon",

    "date": "2026-05-14",

    "gst": 0.34,

    "total": 17.41,

    "items": [

        {"type": "Sliced Turkey", quantity="250G", "price": 6.29}

    ]

}



The date may be in YYYY-MM-DD or YY-MM-DD format.
